26-04-04T15:09:01Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T19:48:58Z","closed_at":"2026-04-13T16:47:49Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n\n- Reproducible in: official godot-mono builds: v4.7.dev3.mono.official.60fff00a6, v4.6.2, v4.6, v4.5.2; nixpkgs: v4.6\n- Not reproducible in: any non mono build.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev3.mono - cpe:/o:nixos:nixos:26.05 #1-NixOS SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Wed Mar 25 10:13:32 UTC 2026 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 Laptop GPU - AMD Ryzen 9 5900HX with Radeon Graphics (16 threads) - 31.19 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI was going to submit the issue to nixpkgs assuming it is a packaging issue, but I also downloaded official builds of v4.7.dev3, v4.6.2, v4.6 and v4.5.2 and they all crashes.\n\nThe crashing also seems very random. Sometimes it crashes right after clicking \"Remove\" button of the confirm modal dialog. Sometimes it crashes after resizing the window. Sometimes it crashes after clicking around a bit. And the console may or may not print anything. But the editor will always crash shortly after deleting an file if not immediately.\n\nI still suspect there is something wrong on my machine, but I have no idea how to diagnose it.\n\nI've attached some logs either from the console or the crashed processes viewer. These are from four different crashes:\n\n[console.1.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26481438/console.1.log)\n[console.2.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26481435/console.2.log)\n[crashed-processes-viewer.1.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26481436/crashed-processes-viewer.1.log)\n[crashed-processes-viewer.2.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26481437/crashed-processes-viewer.2.log)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Have a `godot-mono` build.\n- Create a new project.\n- Right click in the \"FileSystem\" panel, select \"New Scene...\"\n- Create a new scene via the modal.\n- Delete the newly created scene via the \"FileSystem\" panel.\n- (if it didn't crash) Click the \"Debugger\" tab and then resize the editor window.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nedit: See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118189#issuecomment-4236233287","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118189/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118189/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}